# Interactive BADA bank/load ABORT and evidence-flush gate.
# Run with: IC research/pybada-envelope-lateral-abort
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === PYBADATEM LATERAL ENVELOPE ABORT GATE ===
00:00:00.05>ECHO TEST INFO This gate records safely before commanding an excessive coordinated-turn bank.
00:00:00.10>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.20>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.30>PERFMODEL BADA4
00:00:01.00>CRE LABT,A320-232,41.30,2.10,90,FL200,250
00:00:01.10>DYNAMICS LABT TEM
00:00:01.15>BADACONFIG LABT CRUISE
00:00:01.20>BANK LABT 70
00:00:01.30>ENVELOPECHECKS LABT CUSTOM BANK_ANGLE LOAD_FACTOR
00:00:01.40>ENVELOPE LABT ABORT
00:00:02.00>RECORDRESEARCH START pybada-envelope-lateral-abort.csv
00:00:02.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT No QUALITY event should have occurred yet because LABT is not turning.
00:00:03.00>ECHO TEST ACTION Commanding a turn with 70 degrees. Expect one ABORTED event followed by HOLD.
00:00:03.10>HDG LABT 270
